hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17365","Haddathana Sufyan, from Amr, meaning Ibn Dinar, from Amr ibn Abd Allah ibn Safwan, from Yazid ibn Shayban, he said: Ibn Mirba al-Ansari came to us while we were in a distant place of the standing, so he said: I am the messenger of the Messenger of Allah to you, saying: Stay upon these rites of yours, for you are upon an inheritance from the inheritance of Ibrahim, for a place Amr distanced."
